[6:43AM] #LagIbdExpWay
#3MB
#TrafficUpdate

Traffic is very encouraging on the entire stretch from Berger enroute Tollgate and Iyana Oworo at the moment.

Connecting the Third mainland bridge towards Iyana Oworo, Ilubirin, Sura and Flag house looks good as well.

The return journey through the Third mainland bridge back to Iyana Oworo is free.
A bit slow approaching Ifako bus stop being a rehabilitation area.

Traffic is faster exiting the rehabilitation point heading back to Tollgate and Berger.
